{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09461","headline":"横塘行 · 韦应物","name":"横塘行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家住横塘，夫壻郗家郎。\n玉盘的历双白鱼，宝簟玲珑透象牀。\n象牀可寝鱼可食，不知郎意何南北。\n岸上种莲岂得生，池中种槿岂得成。\n丈夫一去花落树，妾独夜长心未平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}